# Apache VirtualHost snippet for https://gc-alexandria.imwald.eu/
#
# Place inside the TLS vhost for that ServerName (after SSLEngine / certificates).
# Container listens on 127.0.0.1:9071 (see docker-compose.prod.yml).
#
# The SPA talks to Nostr relays and Mercury HTTPS directly. `/api/asciidoctor` is
# proxied for EPUB/PDF export (Wikistr sidecar — same layout as jumble).

ProxyPreserveHost On
ProxyRequests Off

# EPUB/PDF export — Wikistr AsciiDoctor (same path as jumble).
# Prefer jumble's public sidecar; swap to http://127.0.0.1:8091/ if you run Wikistr locally.
ProxyPass        /api/asciidoctor/ https://jumble.imwald.eu/api/asciidoctor/
ProxyPassReverse /api/asciidoctor/ https://jumble.imwald.eu/api/asciidoctor/

ProxyPass        / http://127.0.0.1:9071/
ProxyPassReverse / http://127.0.0.1:9071/

ProxyAddHeaders On
Header always set X-Forwarded-Proto "https"
Header always set X-Forwarded-Port "443"
